{{Headline|25|PvP World Rota Changes}}
The current active rota is '''Period B'''. For the next '''two weeks'', until Thursday 28th of June. More information can be found on the dedicated [https://www.runescape.com/oldschool/pvpworldrota PvP World Rota page], which will be updated every two weeks.

*The Standard PvP world will be W25, in the UK.
*The High Risk PvP world be W37, in the USA.
*The F2P PvP world will be W71, in the UK.
*The Bounty Hunter world will be W19, in the USA. 

